  "fullDescription": "Spooky Christmas Coloring Book for Kids\n\nFind peace, reflection, and creative comfort with this uplifting collection of Bible Bold & Easy Coloring Pages. Designed with clean, bold outlines and simple, soothing illustrations, this book is perfect for adults who enjoy faith-centered art and relaxing, meaningful coloring moments.Each page features beautifully styled Bible verses, inspirational Christian themes, and comforting faith symbols.\n\nThe artwork is created with easy-to-color lines, making every design ideal for beginners, seniors, and anyone seeking calm, positive creativity.Whether you’re looking to reconnect with your faith, enjoy peaceful creative time, or create beautiful scripture art, this book brings spiritual encouragement to every page.Relax, reflect, and color your way through God’s Word — one bold, inspiring design at a time.\n\nThis Interior Download Details:\n✅ Size 8.5″ X 8.5″ Inch\n✅ 01 PDF File\n✅ 01 EPS File\n✅ High Resolution (300 Dpi)\n✅ 60 JPG Images File ( 300 Dpi )\n✅ 60 PNG Images File ( 300 Dpi )\n✅ 60 SVG Images File ( 300 Dpi )\n✅ Black And White.\nThis Interior Book Cover Details:\n✅10JPG file ( 300 dpi )",
